==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} ''[[#Old Norse|ganga]]''.

===Verb===
'''ganga''' (''intransitive, strong conjugation:'' [[gekk]] – [[gengum]] – [[gengið]])

# to [[walk]]
#: ''Hvert viltu '''ganga'''?''
#:: Where do you want to '''walk''' to?
# {{context|of machinery|lang=is}} to [[work]], [[operate]], [[run]]
#: '''Gengur''' klukkan?
#:: ''Does the clock '''work'''?''
# to [[go]] (well or badly)
#: [[hreinsun|Hreinsunin]] '''gengur''' [[vel]].
#:: ''The cleaning is '''going''' well.''
# to [[fit]], be [[satisfactory]], [[do]]
#: [[halda|Heldurðu]] að þessi kjóll '''gangi''' ekki við [[rauður|rauðu]] [[kápa|kápuna]] mína?
#:: ''Don't you think this dress will '''go''' with my red coat?''

